OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car set alight in Glasgow
OL,4,Aamid Bonfire Night trouble
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police vehicle has been set on fire
OL,7,Fand fireworks have been launched at
OL,8,Fofficers as Bonfire Night disorder
OL,9,Fbroke out in parts of Scotland.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to reports of an
OL,12,Finjured man on Greenside Street in the
OL,13,FProvanmill area of Glasgow at about
OL,14,F19:55 on Thursday. While in attendance,
OL,15,Fthe police and ambulance crews were
OL,16,Ftargeted with fireworks.
OL,18,FDozens of people watched as a police
OL,19,Fcar was set alight in the middle of a
OL,20,Fresidential street near to other
OL,21,Fvehicles. Emergency services were
OL,22,Fforced to withdraw from the area.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
