OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car set alight in Glasgow
OL,4,Aamid Bonfire Night trouble
OL,5,
OL,6,FOperation Amberlight specialist
OL,7,Fresources were deployed, and one man
OL,8,Fwas arrested. Inquiries are ongoing and
OL,9,Fpolice maintain a presence in the area.
